 REMARKS&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;COLUMN_DEF&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt; SQL_DATA_TYPE 1111&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 SQL_DATETIME_SUB null&lt;br/&gt;
 CHAR_OCTET_LENGTH 2147483647&lt;br/&gt;
 ORDINAL_POSITION 3&lt;br/&gt;
 IS_NULLABLE YES&lt;br/&gt;
 SCOPE_CATLOG&lt;br/&gt;
 SCOPE_SCHEMA&lt;br/&gt;
 SCOPE_TABLE&lt;br/&gt;
 SOURCE_DATA_TYPE null&lt;br/&gt;
 IS_AUTOINCREMENT NO&lt;br/&gt;
 IS_GENERATEDCOLUMN NO&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Column b and c has the wrong&#160;DATA_TYPE and&#160;TYPE_NAME.&lt;/p&gt;

